#
# Fail-witness for ex:saTraceFinalityNoRuleBody. A rule whose body atom reifies a
# watermarkPacket statement, in the reified-atom form rule bodies use, derives a
# statement from a watermark. Unioned with the module, it makes the ban's ASK
# hold. The real module never carries it.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ce:    <https://example.org/trace-finality/counter-examples/> .

ce:finalizedFromWatermark a logic:Rule ;
    logic:head [ rdf:reifies <<( ce:someCut ce:finalizes ce:somePacket )>> ] ;
    logic:body [ rdf:reifies <<( ce:someCut gmeow:watermarkPacket ce:somePacket )>> ] .
